benchmarks/data/
campaigns/

# Trajectories (regenerable, often large)
*.dcd
*.xtc
*.trr

# PLUMED output. Campaign runs direct these under campaigns/ via an absolute
# output_dir, but PLUMED resolves any stray relative FILE= against the process
# working directory — which once dropped a campaign's HILLS in the repo root.
HILLS
HILLS.*
COLVAR
COLVAR.*
bck.*

# GROMACS derived files. All of these are produced by the adapter's setup and
# run pipeline; none are inputs worth versioning.
*.tpr
*.cpt
*.edr
mdout.mdp
step*.pdb
\#*\#

# OpenMM checkpoints
*.chk

# Slide decks and their generators. Presentation material is not part of the
# codebase; keep it local rather than versioning build scripts and exports.
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.odp
*.key
slides/
deck/
presentation*/
*-deck.html
*-slides.html
make_ppt*.py
build_deck*.py
generate_slides*.py

